  "segments": [
   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.52,
    "text": "This is a primary indicator that you're dealing with parasites"
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 2.52,
    "end": 3.64,
    "text": "and you don't even know it."
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 3.64,
    "end": 4.48,
    "text": "My name is Dr. Lake,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 4.48,
    "end": 5.76,
    "text": "I'm a functional medicine practitioner"
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 5.76,
    "end": 7.56,
    "text": "and the creator of the active life program"
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 7.56,
    "end": 10.0,
    "text": "where I've helped hundreds of women get out the root cause"
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 10.0,
    "end": 12.84,
    "text": "of their hormonal imbalances and autoimmune conditions."
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 12.84,
    "end": 14.56,
    "text": "The first thing to understand about parasites"
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 14.56,
    "end": 17.28,
    "text": "is that they stimulate TH2 immune cells,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 17.28,
    "end": 18.96,
    "text": "which actually create antibodies."
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 18.96,
    "end": 23.0,
    "text": "The second thing they do is they actually suppress TH1 cells,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 23.0,
    "end": 25.08,
    "text": "which are our part of your innate immune system."
   },
   {
    "id": "t13",
    "start": 25.08,
    "end": 27.04,
    "text": "So the number one indicator of parasites"
   },
   {
    "id": "t14",
    "start": 27.04,
    "end": 29.32,
    "text": "is actually an autoimmune condition."
   },
   {
    "id": "t15",
    "start": 29.32,
    "end": 31.8,
    "text": "So things like MS, celiac disease, fibromyalgia,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t16",
    "start": 31.8,
    "end": 35.04,
    "text": "Hashimoto's can all be linked back to parasite activity."
   },
   {
    "id": "t17",
    "start": 35.04,
    "end": 36.8,
    "text": "Issue is if you don't fix the problem"
   },
   {
    "id": "t18",
    "start": 36.8,
    "end": 37.76,
    "text": "and get out the root cause,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t19",
    "start": 37.76,
    "end": 39.4,
    "text": "you're likely to develop other"
   },
   {
    "id": "t20",
    "start": 39.4,
    "end": 41.04,
    "text": "autoimmune conditions down the road."
   },
   {
    "id": "t21",
    "start": 41.04,
    "end": 42.16,
    "text": "So in my online program,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t22",
    "start": 42.16,
    "end": 43.56,
    "text": "I talk a lot about foods to include"
   },
   {
    "id": "t23",
    "start": 43.56,
    "end": 45.52,
    "text": "and foods to avoid as well as meal plans"
   },
   {
    "id": "t24",
    "start": 45.52,
    "end": 46.72,
    "text": "and supplements to actually get"
   },
   {
    "id": "t25",
    "start": 46.72,
    "end": 48.4,
    "text": "out the root cause of this naturally."
   },
   {
    "id": "t26",
    "start": 48.4,
    "end": 50.04,
    "text": "If this sounds like something you might be interested in,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t27",
    "start": 50.04,
    "end": 52.36,
    "text": "be sure to drop the word interested in the comment section"
   },
   {
    "id": "t28",
    "start": 52.36,
    "end": 54.16,
    "text": "and I will reach out to you directly."
   }
  ]
 },
